NAME
       killall - signal processes by name

SYNOPSIS
       killall [-q] [-s sig | -SIG] name ...

DESCRIPTION
       Sends a signal, TERM by default, to every process whose name is
       NAME. A user reaches only their own processes.

OPTIONS
       -q       do not complain when nothing matched
       -s SIG   send SIG, given by name or number
       -SIG     the same: -9 or -KILL

EXAMPLES
       killall doom
       killall -9 weston

SEE ALSO
       kill(1), ps(1)
